<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent criminal activity in Ecuador continues with the murder of journalist Tomás Beltrán outside his home despite protective measures, and the shooting deaths of two local election candidates in El Oro. A priest was killed when a crucifix fell during mass, and a journalist was injured in a West Bank settler attack, reflecting broader threats to media figures. The crisis also features a large U.S. jewelry heist linked to an accused Ecuadorian thief and a gang highway robbery of soybeans. These incidents show an expansion from prison gang fights to high-profile targeted killings and major thefts, 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE1oRXRQUF95bHFfeW1jM1E2dDhOMnMwWWRuRGxVMGp3dElscUxDTGR3aENpNEFOOHFWWGFiQm5PT1BDSko5Smk3SFE1NVN4a3hnMTZXdU9zQzZ4ZHEwak5XYXFIcXhXWFVsVExPWHJERDZNQlNZMHBqcmlIZUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE51UWZQc3Q2NnV5Sy1kVW1tMy1Cb0c4TjNRLUlDd0hyM0tHLTdWN2ZIVDVGZjFQWk1vSmVqd2xuYmRtd3JmMVZBemo3RkVsNEo4TkRGdnd1T0pVLXAxM083NVlJVkxqZk81VzhacDhFN3Vudw?oc=5&quot;&gt;freeyork&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOYXo3eUtCMkxhc19aZ2RPZjlYNENEbEJpd245WFBtaUR1dVZfbHU4SG9tQ3BXZ1FqczFnNW1iblJDeVNCeTlIWlpXUUctN0hHZlJHUi1VSklGV0UtSkxNenhLV1duSmVaQ0FITUhHMkRFM0xPeEo0VmYtZnBvZDdna0JkMmdSUFdKcDZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.transfermarkt.us&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQSEFYX0VWdWVmRU1sTkxBZ3Z1ZUFsa3VOSFMtSXE4T2ZMWGVDRW1JS0dhNjk4ZTFnQTZVc3VXLWhnai1JSFhhRG05amxyMFMxVkFoZUFyRDNQTnpEYnNzSGdiZkhTYTRZQVAxU0VhMXVvZGhObU42MFR5bExSYkRKQVU2NDRoazVzOWdMNVVxekZKX3VvdHlpalV0Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Journalism Pakistan&l